<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Detect Undead</h1>
<p>Sphere: Detection Sphere
Spell Tier: 1
Class: Necromancer (guild level 0), Healer (guild level 5), Paladin (guild level 9, up to 50%)
Also taught by: Kaare, in the back room of the inn in Udgaard (anyone, up to 35%)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast detect undead &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast detect undead</a>   (on yourself)
</pre>
<p>For a while after this spell, the target sees which creatures are undead: 
when they examine an undead or spirit, it shows a (violet) aura.
</p><p>The better your divine power and your skill in the spell, the longer it 
lasts: from a minute up to 
several minutes. You must be standing, not fighting. Practising it needs divine 8. It is also found on 
potions and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Turn Undead</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Detect Alignment</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Detection Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>